{"title":"2016 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 2c","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Verifying_Solutions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Verifying Solutions</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2016 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2c&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>At Willard’s Grocery Store, the cost of 2 apples is the same as the cost of 3 bananas. Ross buys 6 apples and 12 bananas for a total cost of $6.30. Determine the cost of 1 apple.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2c&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> be the cost of one apple and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> be the cost of one banana. Since the cost of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> apples is the same as the cost of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> bananas and the cost of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> apples and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> bananas is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/c/57cc22751d624ccfe526f1127ec370c73b851e10.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$6.30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"40\" height=\"14\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/7/007ffe53c38f77efe73f389b2d4f54e3bc9dfe87.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a = 3b$\" width=\"60\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/9/82986e43b7302ffe6890ee391fcb2eb26a57385c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6a + 12b = 6.30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"125\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>From the first equation, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/b/0bbad1d0fb7e0eb70224a50dbc2afee25e7ba89f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = \\frac{2a}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"57\" height=\"38\" />. We can then plug-in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/b/0bbad1d0fb7e0eb70224a50dbc2afee25e7ba89f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = \\frac{2a}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"57\" height=\"38\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/9/82986e43b7302ffe6890ee391fcb2eb26a57385c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6a + 12b = 6.30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"125\" height=\"16\" /> and get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/c/38c2a82c90e23ebec92808272645de01fffea9a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6a + 12 \\times \\frac{2a}{3} = 6.30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"162\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/5/a2557e59a18fa9e3f2e8a8d72960b68697bb9b9e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6a + 4 \\times 2a = 6.30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"149\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/a/17a9dac4051c5ec49f5713fa9d116d3cb6f631fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6a + 8a = 6.30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"118\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/4/f54cb9ebe6883e55a9f9a8ac9e3843a59d0658b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$14a = 6.30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"86\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/1/b814605e314733ff0e3265db63c6e4d87e7ae382.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\frac{6.30}{14} = \\boxed{\\$0.45}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"149\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Verifying_Solutions\">Verifying Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2c&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Verifying Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/a/34a59ac7ff13de7efd3b1f0156df96338d595b3c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\$0.45$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"77\" height=\"16\" />, we would have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/8/db85c3187f86889868a7caf3539f188a6dd5eadd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\times 0.45 = 3b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"107\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/0/c30ea6f98ccb57213bd731f280695684aa34fa36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3b = 0.90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"75\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/2/412c62b0ae8f7dc11decae814cce32b358feeb7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = \\frac{0.90}{3} = \\$0.30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"136\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Plugging <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/a/34a59ac7ff13de7efd3b1f0156df96338d595b3c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\$0.45$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"77\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/1/d21cf2c1283eafd129653cefd222b6d1edcdcfa9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = \\$0.30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"75\" height=\"16\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/a/8ba2288d0d0119f485bbf5abdf28a677e36c80c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6a + 12b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"69\" height=\"16\" />, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/b/f7b15e6bff3995f96bd24dd1a742498244286464.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 \\times 0.45 + 12 \\times 0.30 = 2.70 + 3.60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"272\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/7/9278bb18e4f7efe313ace027bcf672eaf7ec4b4f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=6.30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"53\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>This matches what the actual price of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> apples and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> bananas, so we have checked our answer.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018001943\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.022 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.072 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 136/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5090/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.485      1 2016_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2\n100.00%    6.485      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35967:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018001943 and revision id 279534. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}